      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我好像猜中了。\n现在我稍微能明白她的想法了……\n应该吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca97dcea6c6e399ad8e851a55031d29d116639eaa5145d59927b0a9bb7e7c5f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
