    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7019194109744a2f46e305f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就是把那些家伙全都打败。\n这样我就能站上顶点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cba9437572fdd2278609476e7d5fb38dbe7f80a6f20a289fa6d2a5708d807c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52625b8b2135c1687b96ed36",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“日本C”结束后立刻就要升上古马级了。\n看来她似乎约略告诉了我\n到时她打算怎么向前迈进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f4126a724aec04b095c6867b86f0e512bd39f0bfc874ba1d94b06a24d32169a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
