    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:597132cba154c961883af527",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要站上顶点……就算不情愿，\n大家也会明白谁才是狠角色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d89123212cc3a8f672f632e8e76dbdca14c91d4a664c7a2fb64fe93b07190a5c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62e1f816a0352f5baac862d8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从她的话里，我能感觉到她是如何解读现状的。\n她在经典三冠竞赛拿下了优异的成绩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7506329833dd8beeff5d5ad3fe6db4d4811f748d22464bd1e243260eb7d3f55",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cb14ab74eb608c330ea0fe1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是大众对她的评价仍然没有太大的提升。\n至于原因，我想她应该分析过了。\n如果她得出的结论是要打败所有比她强的人──",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a5442fb9a524682d8b34876d2bc3e84ee843fda8ecdb7111e495329ef1d467e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
